  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mid 406.06 Participation in the Work of Midwifery-Related Professional Boards or Committees and Participation in the Work of Midwifery-Related Governmental Regulatory Agencies.\n\n(a) Documentation of participation in the work of midwifery-related professional boards, professional committees, and governmental regulatory agencies shall include a letter conforming to (b) below and issued by:\n\n(1) The authority appointing the midwife to the board, committee, or agency; or\n\n(2) The board, committee, or agency served by the midwife.\n\n(b) The letter shall state:\n\n(1) The appointment to the board, committee, or agency; or\n\n(2) The following information:\n\na. The fact of the midwife's participation; and\n\nb. The beginning and ending dates of the midwife's service.\n\nSource. #8840, eff 3-13-07, EXPIRED: 3-13-15\n\nNew. #11095, INTERIM, eff 5-12-16, EXPIRED: 11-8-16\n\nNew. #12040, eff 11-10-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mid400.html"
